.TH PDELAB 1
.SH NAME
pdelab \- interactive partial differential equation simulations
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/pdelab
[
.I mode
]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Pdelab
visualizes three finite-difference field simulations using
.IR pde (2):
heat diffusion, a damped wave equation, and the coupled Gray-Scott
reaction-diffusion equations.
The optional mode is 1, 2, or 3.
.PP
Press 1, 2, or 3 to switch simulation.  Button 1 injects heat, displaces the
wave surface, or adds reagent.  Space pauses, r resets, and q exits.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/pdelab.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR ode (2),
.IR pde (2),
.IR temple (1)
